## Deferred decisions

| Topic | Why deferred |
|---|---|
| Splitting by position ranges (column sharding) | Only helps when F is small and C is huge, and such jobs are already fast on one worker |
| Object storage (S3/MinIO) | A shared folder is enough to run locally |
| Live log via SSE | Polling meets the requirement; SSE is a small later upgrade |